	(text "OSPTEK AM213 reference: 3.3V direct QSPI/I2C; no level shifters.\nJ1.1/2 old backlight isolated; J1.6/15/16 unused.\nIO46 -> VCI_EN, IO47 -> LCD_RST, IO57 -> TP_RST.\nR10/R11 DNP: host I2C pull-ups R45/R46 present.\n70mm tail is mechanical candidate; confirm folding/stack with flex fabricator.\nNo TE to MCU; start QSPI <=10MHz and verify signal/power integrity."
